Title: Mahārāja; Place Of Issue: Khijjinga-Koṭṭa; Date: ?; Officers: ?; Topography: (1) Khijjingakoṭṭa—(Capital)

] . . From the genealogy given in this inscription, it is known that Kotṭabhañja had brother whose name is not given and who was the grandsather of Rā[]bhañja. This Rā[]bhañja is possibly Rājabhañja. Obverse

1. Dondr . . . . Rā[]bhañja, son of Durjaya-bhañja and grand son of Kotṭabhañja. (2) Vijñānigrāma—(V) (3) Pāgurasila pāṭaka—(V) (4) Vikhati—(V) 7. Donce] . . . . Bhatṭa Nārāyaṇa Mitra, son of Bhatṭa Harimitra and grand son of Bhatṭa Lokamitra of Kauśika gotra , Viśvāmitra.-Audāla-Daivarāta pravara and an immigrant from Vikhati, Reverse
